      "quotes": [
        {
          "text": "Great phone, deceptive seller. The actual phone is great. No issues. Love everything about it. I would recommend it. The 3 stars is for the seller, AmazingDeals ShipIn0-1day NoUSSalesTax. First the phone is not mint. It's actually not green in any way. It actually is/called ice blue per Google. Which is fine I like blue too just was looking forward to a mint phone. Second, the seller says it's a...",
          "aspect": "connectivity",
          "sentiment": -0.38902025669813156,
          "stars": 3,
          "month": "2016-09"
        },
        {
          "text": "This is the third Nexus 5x phone I've ordered and .... This is the third Nexus 5x phone I've ordered and none of them have worked! The first one wouldn't connect to the network extender, the second one wouldn't work with Verizon at all and this last one wouldn't even turn on!",
          "aspect": "connectivity",
          "sentiment": -0.9823771514929831,
          "stars": 1,
          "month": "2016-10"
        },
        {
          "text": "Dead at 14 months.. It dies unless I charge it twice per day. Fortunately it has quick charge, which keeps me going. The SIM card slot is an incredible pain to open...like I almost couldn't activate the phone because it took me a long time to get the slot open. I wish it had a memory card slot, but I didn't want to pay more than twice as much for a Samsung S7. And now, in Nov 2017 (14 months...",
          "aspect": "performance",
          "sentiment": -0.5403696950525045,
          "stars": 1,
          "month": "2016-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "I would not recommend this device. I bought two Nexus 5x devices. One for me and one for my wife within a year both devices completely stopped working. I had to ship both back to be replaced. My wife's device is starting to give problems again as well. This device has a lot of lag and freezing as well. I would not recommend this device. If you are looking for a budget phone try the Oneplus 3t or...",
          "aspect": "performance",
          "sentiment": -0.9925620059948415,
          "stars": 1,
          "month": "2016-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "Five Stars. An awesome phone. My wife loves the picture quality.",
          "aspect": "camera",
          "sentiment": 0.9960519591113552,
          "stars": 5,
          "month": "2016-10"
        },
        {
          "text": "Not good for Samsung users. This is a rough transition from my Galaxy Note7 (which was the best phone of all time). It is slower, the camera isn't nearly as good, and worst of all it does not work nicely with Verizon. I continually have to reboot the phone to get it to recognize the 4G LTE signal. Even when all settings are correct, it periodically disconnects from the towers without warning....",
          "aspect": "camera",
